  m_Name: lastcool
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MadeInArizona.MissionDefinition
  id: lastcool
  title: 14. Shade Is Not a Subscription
  region: Sunsprawl Service Core
  briefing: Defend the community cooling controls while the original debt claim is
    challenged. Hold the marked broadcast zone through three heavy response waves.
  opening: 'Johnny: People need the cooling on. We hold this station while the residents
    file the injunction. Nobody leaves anyone outside.'
  midpoint: 'Silt: Their emergency shutdown requires a second signature. Suzuki put
    a paw on the scanner. The system accepted director-level approval.'
  closing: 'Johnny: Cooling restored. Their network now lists Suzuki as interim compliance
    officer. We are not correcting that.'
  optionalObjective: Destroy at least 16 hostile vehicles
